# Scripted route that collects all 12 coins in Level 1.
# Used by the automated playthrough test (tests/CMakeLists.txt) and by
# `px-player --input-script` for demos. Format: docs/input-scripts.md.
# If you change the level layout or the PlatformerController tuning,
# re-check this route with: px-headless examples/platformer --input-script
#   examples/platformer/tests/full_run.input --log-events --trace-every 4

61 move_right            # run; coin 1 is on the path
6  -                     # stop under coin 2
25 jump                  # jump straight up: coin 2
20 -                     # land
22 move_right
26 move_right+jump       # jump the first pit: coin 3 mid-air
20 move_right
24 move_right+jump       # up onto the crates: coin 4
36 move_right            # drop off the crates (jump is buffered below)
28 move_right+jump       # over the second pit onto the metal platform: coins 5 and 6
30 move_right
30 move_right+jump       # platform to the raised ground: coin 7
31 move_right
26 move_right+jump       # third pit: coin 8 mid-air
14 move_right
26 move_right+jump       # onto the high platform
6  move_right
26 move_right+jump       # jump from the high platform: coin 9, land on the last stretch
72 move_right            # coins 10 and 11 are on the path
30 move_right+jump       # final jump: coin 12
20 -
